[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12421.67, "timestamp": "03:27:01", "text": "软件之类的东西。所以我当时在使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12424.389, "timestamp": "03:27:04", "text": "那就是向信徒们传递信息。所以，我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12426.229, "timestamp": "03:27:06", "text": "要使用 OBS 虚拟摄像头，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12429.19, "timestamp": "03:27:09", "text": "将 OBS 的音频路由到该软件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12431.75, "timestamp": "03:27:11", "text": "使用虚拟电缆。然后进行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12435.83, "timestamp": "03:27:15", "text": "溪流。什么？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12440.309, "timestamp": "03:27:20", "text": "是的。真是太麻烦了。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.429, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "现在他们已经达到了10000人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12446.22, "timestamp": "03:27:26", "text": "粉丝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12448.15, "timestamp": "03:27:28", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12451.429, "timestamp": "03:27:31", "text": "那是……不，那也太过分了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12456.55, "timestamp": "03:27:36", "text": "一次疯狂的跳跃。从 100 到 10,000。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12460.07, "timestamp": "03:27:40", "text": "是的。大家都对此感到愤怒。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12462.63, "timestamp": "03:27:42", "text": "就是那时，我从中学到了很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12466.309, "timestamp": "03:27:46", "text": "我之前在和那个油管博主聊天……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12469.429, "timestamp": "03:27:49", "text": "就像很多 YouTuber 一样，他们必须喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12472.95, "timestamp": "03:27:52", "text": "战斗和很多事情，仅仅因为他们能活下来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12476.469, "timestamp": "03:27:56", "text": "在那个平台上，因为就像很多……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.429, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "功能和东西将会非常丰富"}]